{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id482767937"}, "name":{"label":"hdbqlbdjwbs"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-14T19:50:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13267852131"}, "title":{"label":"Favorite game in the world -pls fix fighting bug!"}, "content":{"label":"Though i know you’re very busy, any attention on this area would be greatly appreciated. \nI have this game on my console for multiplayer, pc for mods and mobile for- well, being mobile. The combat on the mobile version specifically has a tendency to just let you die in auto mode, which is basically the only playable way for every area of the game combined. You’ll be holding your sword and it will just not. do. anything. you try to block them and it just allows the monster to hit you. I’ve gotten through the normal caves after some serious turmoil but since i can’t allow the green bugs to hit me more than a few times, there’s no getting through like there is on pc and console. Thanks for an awesome game!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
