{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1482471391"}, "name":{"label":"Am-pel"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-07T22:52:59-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13238604194"}, "title":{"label":"Nice"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a nice game, definitely recommend. Allows you to explore and do things on your own time and on your own pace. All while still sticking into the main role play aspect. The first few years are the most enjoyable, but like most games after completing to a certain level things stale out a little. That’s where different farms come in, or even co-ops which they are experimenting currently with which all can help with more experiences. But even then completing it is no easy task, if your not speed running things this game is definitely long run. 10/10", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
