{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1265105930"}, "name":{"label":"Ricco4242"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-30T16:55:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13206798876"}, "title":{"label":"Great game with a catch"}, "content":{"label":"I have been loving this game it’s relaxing and has it’s addictive points. The catch is that it’s unplayable on the iPhone. The camera oval covers the entire backpack selection box making your inventory virtually inaccessible. In any other game I’d give this a 1-star review but the game is just so much fun and at so low a cost I just can’t justify lowering the score. Really it’s an apple problem.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id953095222"}, "name":{"label":"krysedwards"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-27T19:52:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13194247788"}, "title":{"label":"Could be 5 stars if they could figure out how to add a save option"}, "content":{"label":"Will make you waste countless hours on it and then break your heart by deleting everything you do. There is no way save it other than going to sleep which doesn’t actually save it at all. My brand new iPad died ONCE and I lost more than a year of game play because there is no save option. Losing one or two days is one thing, an entire year in the game?!?! You lost me. It’s almost 2026, a save option shouldn’t need to be suggested. I’m not playing 1970’s pong for a reason.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1835725573"}, "name":{"label":"SebsterHgn"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-27T18:28:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13194025503"}, "title":{"label":"Health"}, "content":{"label":"I can’t see the health bar properly on the iPhone 17 with even having the tool screen shortened. I never had that issue on android.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1574641371"}, "name":{"label":"KrobusLicorice"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-27T17:44:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13193907987"}, "title":{"label":"Best game and purchase I have ever made"}, "content":{"label":"I love this game I am addicted. I have over a hundred hours yet have barely scratched the surface of this amazing game. There are so many different playstyles, you can kill monsters, farm, fish, befriend, craft, cook, decorate and so much more. I love krobus as he gives me an opportunity to fulfill the achievement and stardrop for friendship/ having a housemate without having to get married, he’s just so adorable in his own way. There are many things to do post main game, which I would say is completing the community center (or if you have no soul, going the Kona route) it also has a wonderful community with co op local if you just look up a little Easter egg, there is so much to discover for casual players and completionists alike, this is my favorite game ever and is very well priced.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
