{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1362399736"}, "name":{"label":"Noelle Wiseman"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-18T10:27:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13153594132"}, "title":{"label":"Favorite game! But I wish cross play was available"}, "content":{"label":"This game is awesome. it’s been a great game for me and my long distance fiancé to play at night while on face time. We work together with the farm but the competitiveness comes in for us at the caverns and caves it’s us against the clock and each other trying to find the latter first. 😅 \nWe hacked through for the co-op to play long distance in mobile but I do hope in the future it comes available to cross play from X-box to mobile as my fiancé will play till the crack of dawn as I fall asleep drooling on my phone 😂 he wants to co-op our world on Xbox while I’m on mobile so he can play better as his phone is getting old and crashing every 30 minutes.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
