{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1737597377"}, "name":{"label":"Soulstrum"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-14T13:22:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13137945210"}, "title":{"label":"I like it a lot"}, "content":{"label":"My brother would always play this when I was young. It is everything I wanted. The only things that I wish to add is that the kids grow to be older. Like grow up to be up to a teenager. Also I wish there were more options for pets like birds and snakes. But overall it is a wonderful cozy and holsome game.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1684099188"}, "name":{"label":"Crackedbutshort"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-10T05:30:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13120779383"}, "title":{"label":"1000/10"}, "content":{"label":"Let me come out and say… CONCERNED APE COOKED on Stardew valley. I have just about 175 hours on this game, beware it is addictive. It’s a flexible kind of game if you want to play casual and just relax after a long day, or… you can grind to make 80 mil in the first year :). It’s to you. The price is totally worth it on both mobile and any other device. You will almost guarantee at least 10 hours of your life on a his game.1000/10", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
