{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id606971549"}, "name":{"label":"MrNimbusTV"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-01T22:09:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13088874734"}, "title":{"label":"Not Good on Mobile"}, "content":{"label":"The game gives you some options to adjust menu spacing and other UI, but it is extremely limited! No matter what some things get cut off or are extremely awkward on the screen. Love this game but not on mobile. It’s practically unplayable.\n\nNot even able to refund while only playing for a couple minutes! Very upsetting.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1035780774"}, "name":{"label":"Some1 :3"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-30T10:15:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13079228799"}, "title":{"label":"Please read this before you buy it"}, "content":{"label":"Contents: \nfirst paragraph: story, \nsecond paragraph: glitches, \nthird paragraph: possible improvements  ,\nfourth paragraph : the rating.\nStardew valley is a very good game. I got it because my sibling had it and it looked fun, so I made the decision to buy it. It was super fun at first. Discovering everything was a blast. Then, I kinda got bored of it for a while. Next time I came back, I started to get addicted, and wanted to play all the time. I made a lot of progress but then, one day (Stardew valley day), I was exploring the settings. I pushed the button second from the top( called “reset to previous save”(I think) ) and it restarded my whole day! This is really sad because I made a lot of progress and it restarded the day. I pressed the button again to try to fix it but it went back another day. And etc. I kept having to redo the day and I didn’t know that was happening. It glitched a lot and made me frustrated. Here are some of the glitches:\nDeleted random items (such as cloth, horse, horse stable, mystery box) , in early game play the realing in sound for fishing got stuck and I had to restart the game, and some items , mostly in big chests have an outlining.\nSome things I think you could improve is maybe a guide to things so I don’t have to look it up on line.\nOver all, I think Stardew valley gets about 3 stars out of 5 . Thank you for reading!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
